owners. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Huawei.

BUILD DEPENDENCIES

The engine includes headers from the following projects at build time. None of
their source is redistributed here; supply them at configure time.

  NVIDIA CUTLASS / CuTe          BSD-3-Clause
  FlashInfer                     Apache-2.0
  NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit, incl. CUB NVIDIA Software Licence Agreement
  PCRE2                          BSD-3-Clause (linked)

Their licence terms apply to those components and are not superseded by the
LICENSE file in this repository.

